      "wrong_answer": "The main topics of the uploaded documents can be summarized as follows:\n\n1. The role of art in society\n2. The impact of technology on creativity\n3. The relationship between art and culture\n4. The influence of societal norms on artistic expression\n5. The importance of preserving cultural heritage through art\n6. The intersection of art, science, and technology\n7. The social and economic benefits of art\n8. The role of art in promoting diversity and inclusivity\n9. The relationship between art and mental health\n10. The future of art in the digital age\n\nOne example from one of the texts is:\n\n\"The Role of Art in Society\" by John Smith (2015).\n\nThis text discusses how art plays a significant role in society, including its ability to promote social change and cultural understanding. It also explores the relationship between art and technology, highlighting the ways in which digital tools can enhance artistic expression. The citation for this text is:\n\nSmith, J. (2015). \"The Role of Art in Society.\" Journal of Creative Studies, 3(1), 27-45.\n\nThis example illustrates how art can be used to promote social change and cultural understanding, which aligns with the broader theme of the importance of art in society.",
